 data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}_{G,\\cdot,e_G}\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}_{G,\\cdot,e_G}\\in V\\)</span> (inverse graph determined by the displayed group data)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalGroup}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalGroup}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalAction}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalAction}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates with the group identity explicit)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}inverse} \\vdash \\operatorname{inv}_{G,\\cdot,e_G}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle g,h\\rangle\\in G\\times G:g\\cdot h=e_G\\land h\\cdot g=e_G\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}inverse} \\vdash \\operatorname{inv}_{G,\\cdot,e_G}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle g,h\\rangle\\in G\\times G:g\\cdot h=e_G\\land h\\cdot g=e_G\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{TopologicalGroup}_S(G,\\tau_G,\\cdot,e_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e_G=g)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(G,\\tau_G)\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\cdot,G\\times G,\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(G,\\tau_G,G,\\tau_G),G,\\tau_G)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{inv}_{G,\\cdot,e_G},G,G)\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\operatorname{inv}_{G,\\cdot,e_G},G,\\tau_G,G,\\tau_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{TopologicalGroup}_S(G,\\tau_G,\\cdot,e_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e_G=g)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(G,\\tau_G)\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\cdot,G\\times G,\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(G,\\tau_G,G,\\tau_G),G,\\tau_G)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{inv}_{G,\\cdot,e_G},G,G)\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\operatorname{inv}_{G,\\cdot,e_G},G,\\tau_G,G,\\tau_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}action} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrincipalAction}_S(\\rho,p,P,G,\\cdot,e_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(p,P,\\operatorname{ran}(p))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,G\\times G,G)\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,P\\times G,P)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;(\\rho(u,e_G)=u)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\forall g,h\\in G\\;(\\rho(\\rho(u,g),h)=\\rho(u,g\\cdot h))\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;(p(\\rho(u,g))=p(u))\\land\\forall u,v\\in P\\;(p(u)=p(v)\\to\\exists!g\\in G\\;(\\rho(u,g)=v))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}action} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrincipalAction}_S(\\rho,p,P,G,\\cdot,e_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(p,P,\\operatorname{ran}(p))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,G\\times G,G)\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,P\\times G,P)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;(\\rho(u,e_G)=u)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\forall g,h\\in G\\;(\\rho(\\rho(u,g),h)=\\rho(u,g\\cdot h))\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;(p(\\rho(u,g))=p(u))\\land\\forall u,v\\in P\\;(p(u)=p(v)\\to\\exists!g\\in G\\;(\\rho(u,g)=v))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TopologicalGroup}_S(G,\\tau_G,\\cdot,e_G)\\land\\mathrm{Bundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G)\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\rho,P\\times G,\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(P,\\tau_P,G,\\tau_G),P,\\tau_P)\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalAction}_S(\\rho,p,P,G,\\cdot,e_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrincipalBundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G,\\rho,\\cdot,e_G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TopologicalGroup}_S(G,\\tau_G,\\cdot,e_G)\\land\\mathrm{Bundle}_S(p,P,\\tau_P,M,\\tau_M,G,\\tau_G)\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(\\rho,P\\times G,\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(P,\\tau_P,G,\\tau_G),P,\\tau_P)\\land\\mathrm{PrincipalAction}_S(\\rho,p,P,G,\\cdot,e_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Principal bundles have fibers modeled on a group acting freely and transitively.</li>\n<li>The displayed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_G\">\\(e_G\\)</span> is verified as the group identity, and the inverse map is the unique graph determined by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_G\">\\(e_G\\)</span>; continuity is therefore not asserted for an unbound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)^{-1}\">\\((-)^{-1}\\)</span> symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"e1e5dca961f5c9ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2e63b755a37f1dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":fals